 "_about": "The Erechtheion as it was painted: its frieze of dark Eleusinian limestone (white marble figures were pinned to it) running round the walls and over both porches, the Ionic capitals' volutes' channels gilt and their echinus of eggs and darts painted red and blue (with glass beads in the necks, too small to see here), a meander on every abacus, the maidens' capitals so and the architrave over them with its band, the tympana blue, the coffers blue with gold stars, the roofs in marble tiles, the columns fluted (24 flutes). (The maidens themselves are painted statues: statues.js.)",
